{"toolCallId":"call_2d63b8c5f354476ab094df6121f7f7c5","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"alignment-drift-fixture-preservation.vitest.ts\nanchor-contract.vitest.ts\nanchor-nesting-severity.vitest.ts\nanchor-repair-sample.vitest.ts\narchitecture-boundary-enforcement.vitest.ts\narchive-track.vitest.ts\nascii-boxes.vitest.ts\nauto-detection-fixes.vitest.ts\nbackfill-frontmatter.vitest.ts\nbackfill-prune-report-gate.vitest.ts\nbackfill-research-metadata.vitest.ts\ncalculate-completeness-script.vitest.ts\ncanonical-save-validation.vitest.ts\ncanonical-sources-auto-discovery.vitest.ts\ncheck-ac-closure.sh\ncheck-ac-coverage.sh\ncheck-frontmatter-values.vitest.ts\ncheck-graph-metadata-child-drift.sh\ncheck-graph-metadata-shape-last-active-child.sh\ncheck-source-dist-alignment-orphans.vitest.ts\ncheck-source-tags.vitest.ts\nci-rule-set-comparison.vitest.ts\nclaude-code-native-dispatch-docs.vitest.ts\ncollect-session-data.vitest.ts\ncontamination-filter.vitest.ts\ncontent-filter-parity.vitest.ts\ncontinuity-freshness.vitest.ts\ncreate-root-numbering.vitest.ts\ncreate-track-refresh.vitest.ts\ncreate-unknown-options.vitest.ts\ncreate-without-build.vitest.ts\ndaemon-detect.vitest.ts\ndecision-confidence.vitest.ts\ndeep-research-contract-parity.vitest.ts\ndeep-research-reducer.vitest.ts\ndeep-review-auto-restart-contract.vitest.ts\ndeep-review-contract-parity.vitest.ts\ndeep-review-reducer-schema.vitest.ts\ndescription-enrichment.vitest.ts\ndist-freshness-walker.vitest.ts\n---\n---\ntitle: \"Script Tests\"\ndescription: \"Test entrypoints and fixtures for system-spec-kit shell scripts, TypeScript modules and integration workflows.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"spec kit tests\"\n  - \"test validation\"\n  - \"upgrade-level tests\"\n---\n\n<!-- markdownlint-disable MD025 -->\n\n# Script Tests\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n`runtime/cli/tests/` validates script behavior across shell workflows, JavaScript\nsmoke tests, Python checks and Vitest regression suites. It covers validation\norchestration, memory pipeline seams, phase workflows, import policy, template\nrendering and utility contracts.\n\nTests assume the resume contract where packet context is recovered from\n`handover.md -> _memory.continuity -> spec docs`; generated memory artifacts\nremain supporting fixtures or outputs.\n\n---\n\n## 2. PACKAGE TOPOLOGY\n\n```text\nruntime/cli/tests/\n+-- test-*.js                 # Node smoke and integration tests\n+-- test-*.sh                 # Shell validation and phase workflow tests\n+-- check-*.sh                # Rule harnesses the validation lane runs after the suites\n+-- test_dual_threshold.py    # Python threshold check\n+-- *.vitest.ts               # TypeScript regression suites\n+-- *.test.mjs                # node:test suites (Hermes skill-copy generator)\n+-- fixtures/                 # Test-local fixtures\n+-- snapshots/                # Golden snapshots (vitest resolveSnapshotPath)\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"b545c3","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
